## Third-Party Licenses

PrXpice links against the following open-source libraries. Their licenses are
reproduced below or linked to their respective project pages.

### LGPL-2.1 Libraries
The following libraries are licensed under the GNU Lesser General Public
License version 2.1. Source code is available at their respective project
repositories. Users wishing to relink PrXpice against modified versions of
these libraries may build the project from source using Scripts/build-deps.sh.

- **GLib** (glib-2.0, gobject-2.0, gio-2.0, gmodule-2.0, gthread-2.0)
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/glib
- **gettext / libintl**
  https://www.gnu.org/software/gettext/
- **libiconv**
  https://www.gnu.org/software/libiconv/
- **json-glib**
  https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/json-glib
- **spice-client-glib** (spice-gtk)
  https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/spice/spice-gtk

### Apache 2.0
- **OpenSSL** 3.2.1
  https://www.openssl.org

### MIT
- **libffi**
